WEBVTT

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.773
But in this case,

00:06:00.773 --> 00:06:03.818
skills and experiences are the currency.

00:06:04.777 --> 00:06:07.488
So if you take an evening
course in accounting,

00:06:07.488 --> 00:06:09.615
deposit that into your bank.

00:06:10.533 --> 00:06:13.411
If you do a summer internship
at a marketing firm,

00:06:13.411 --> 00:06:15.955
deposit that into your bank.

00:06:17.456 --> 00:06:19.583
If we're able to do this,

00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:21.919
and do this at scale,

00:06:21.961 --> 00:06:27.049
we could dramatically decrease
the time to complete a degree,

00:06:27.091 --> 00:06:29.009
therefore drive down cost.